            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>Supplementing in cycles is the proper way of using vitamins, minerals and herbs. You could use it non-stop, but it is always better to cycle between periods of use and disuse. Preferably, taking it only when you need a nutrient boost (except for specific health conditions.</p><p>Supplementing in cycles is the proper way of using vitamins, <a href=\"https://everestshilajit.com/pages/trace-minerals\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"trace minerals\">minerals</a> and herbs. You could use it non-stop, but it is always better to cycle between periods of use and disuse. Preferably, taking it only when you need a nutrient boost (except for specific health conditions.</p><p><strong>Note: </strong>Not recommended for anyone under 18<strong> </strong>due to limited research on safety and benefits.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": ""
          }
