    "basmil_image_text_9RXdkD": {
      "type": "basmil-image-text",
      "blocks": {
        "content_tNzmmB": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Soft Resin<brown> Everest Shilajit</brown>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<ol><li>Take 300-500 mg of shilajit resin with the spoon that comes with the product.</li><li>Mix the resin in warm water, milk, or herbal tea for better absorption.</li><li> Consume it on an empty stomach for optimal results.</li></ol><p>Start with a pea-sized shilajit dosage, ranging from 300 mg to 500 mg. After a few days, depending on your reaction and results, you can gradually increase the dosage to 1 gram per day. Dissolve the resin in warm water, milk, or herbal tea for better absorption. </p><p>For optimal results, it's best to take Shilajit in the morning on an empty stomach. Or, you can take it later in the day, but make sure it's at least 3-4 hours after a meal to <a href=\"https://everestshilajit.com/pages/fulvic-and-humic-acids\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"fulvic acid vs humic acid\">Fulvic Acid</a> supplement.</p>",
            "button_text": "",
