            "title": "When Should I <brown>Take Shilajit?</brown>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "description": "<p>Shilajit is ideally taken in the morning on an empty stomach, but there's no generic timing, everyone's routine is different. The yardstick is to consume it on an empty stomach or wait for 3-4 hours after your every meal. Morning is great, but consuming it at any other time works too<strong>. </strong>The only downside of taking it in the evening makes you feel more energetic, potentially affecting your sleep, so better listen to your body.  </p>",
